","evidence":["santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0034","role":"围攻寿春","evidence":["santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f","source_order":[64,89,0],"related_events":[{"event":"shaodi-e-o129a","type":"related","evidence":["santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f","shaodi-e-o129a-q"]},{"event":"santizhu-e-sr-shouchun-fall","type":"related","evidence":["santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f","santizhu-q-a805fae656d71ba8f345"]},{"event":"chenghuang-e-o156","type":"related","evidence":["chenghuang-q-0cf97fa905c953017d83","santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f"]}],"order":11014}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0042","name":"全端","evidence":["shaodi-q-p012","wgc-q0027","wgc-q0067","wgc-q0113","santizhu-q-d2ee51eebfa6287a6fe6","santizhu-q-0933724e6f5a43004cac","santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f","zhanggu-q-2113b80d6f9f8a3da0c7","feipin-q-6d61eca1778d51ea073f"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-p012-shaodi-p0042","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-p012"]},{"id":"shaodi-m-o128-shaodi-p0042","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o128"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o034-shaodi-p0042","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及全端","evidence":["wgc-q0027"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o086-shaodi-p0042","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及全端","evidence":["wgc-q0067"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p032-shaodi-p0042","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及全端","evidence":["wgc-q0113"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-0cf97fa905c953017d83","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-8df1d46a00b273a6bbbc","layer":"original","quote":"太平二年，〔魏大将军诸葛诞据寿春来降，〕魏人围之。遣朱异、唐咨等往救，复使奉与黎斐解围。奉为先登，屯于黎浆〖10〗；力战有功，拜左将军","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"feipin-q-6d61eca1778d51ea073f","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-133fdadf2671af7b34a3","layer":"original","quote":"及魏大将诸葛诞以寿春来附，而全怿、全端、全祎、全仪等，并因此际降魏；全熙谋泄见杀：由是诸全衰弱。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":113,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"hancui-q-2554659cfd2fbba6bd23","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-f3afcdb8c325c1801064","layer":"original","quote":"吴大将全琮帅数万众来侵寇〖21〗；时州兵休使〖22〗，在者无几。礼躬勒卫兵御之，战于芍陂〖23〗；自旦及暮，将士死伤过半。礼犯蹈白刃，马被数创，手秉枹鼓〖24〗，奋不顾身；贼众乃退。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":42,"end":133},{"id":"hequan-q-471873efe3c73342b238","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-7d40498a2406c90a8f04","layer":"original","quote":"救诸葛诞于寿春，出城先降。魏以为平东将军，封临湘侯","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":43},{"id":"panlu-q-0b8229086ad163dff583","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-24dc59549a2a19d246f9","layer":"original","quote":"与诸将共赴寿春。还，累迁荡魏、绥远将军","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":48,"end":67},{"id":"santizhu-q-0933724e6f5a43004cac","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c67c55e25345c5fcaa53","layer":"original","quote":"六月，使文钦、唐咨、全端等，步骑三万救诞","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":151,"end":171},{"id":"santizhu-q-a805fae656d71ba8f345","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-dc57a9e53d35b30f8168","layer":"original","quote":"三月，司马文王克寿春；诞及左右战死，将吏以下皆降。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":41},{"id":"santizhu-q-c64e28841e3e0e9c447b","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-42b7e8e5ba14bda04d7d","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，全端、怿等，自寿春城诣司马文王〖17〗。","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":45},{"id":"santizhu-q-d2ee51eebfa6287a6fe6","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-9b3f5181b40c2019f20c","layer":"original","quote":"使将军全端守西城〖7〗，都尉留略守东城〖8〗","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":14,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":48},{"id":"santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-390d7a804c8a1bdac217","layer":"original","quote":"魏大将军诸葛诞举寿春叛，保城请降。吴遣文钦、唐咨、全端、全怿等帅三万人救之。魏镇南将军王基，围诞〖1〗，钦等突围入城","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":439,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58},{"id":"santizhu064-q-bda3edc70fea50eb99fc","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-95838e6de2d2433642f5","layer":"original","quote":"恪以建兴元年十月，会众于东兴，更作大堤；左右结山夹筑两城〖3〗，各留千人；使全端、留略守之，引军而还。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":46,"end":97},{"id":"shaodi-e-o013a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-0cd1e6082bde64409582","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，吴将朱然等围襄阳之樊城，太傅司马宣王率众拒之。﹝一﹞六月，辛丑〖5〗，退。己卯〖6〗，以征东将军王凌为车骑将军〖7〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63},{"id":"shaodi-e-o128a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b41ba43f7aca70555e83","layer":"original","quote":"冬十二月，吴大将全端、全怿等率众降〖38〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":533,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22},{"id":"shaodi-e-o129a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1abcd215d0c852fc17c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春二月〖1〗，大将军司马文王陷寿春城，斩诸葛诞。三月，诏曰：“古者克敌，收其尸以为京观〖2〗，所以惩昏逆而彰武功也。汉孝武元鼎中〖3〗，改桐乡为闻喜〖4〗，新乡为获嘉〖5〗，以著南越之亡〖6〗。大将军亲总六戎〖7〗，营据丘头〖8〗；内夷群凶〖9〗，外殄寇虏〖10〗；功济兆民，声振四海。克敌之地，宜有令名〖11〗：其改‘丘头’为‘武丘’。明以武平乱，后世不忘；亦京观、二邑之义也〖12〗”。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":575,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":197},{"id":"shaodi-e-p012a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b21524fb470242deda03","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“初，孙权筑东兴堤，以遏巢湖。后征淮南，坏不复修。是岁，诸葛恪帅军更于堤左右，结山挟筑两城；使全端、留略守之，引军而还。诸葛诞言于司马景王曰：‘致人而不致于人者，此之谓也。今因其内侵，使文舒逼江陵，仲恭向武昌，以羁吴之上流；然后简精卒，攻两城：比救至，可大获也！’景王从之。”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fa5c9b0224b3bacd13f","start":0,"end":149},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-20272e7cc5379b3fe346","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-20272e7cc5379b3fe346","layer":"modern","quote":"〖17〗四年：嘉平四年（公元252）。癸卯：旧历初二日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-db96ad991a403b6a010e","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：甘露二年（公元 257 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4dd98e402a6a8de51491","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：正始二年（公元 241）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-bf9ccbeb544f540e6afb","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o012","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33e60ac0c003858f0640","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，帝初通《论语》〖2〗。使太常以太牢祭孔子于辟雍〖3〗，以颜渊配〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"shaodi-q-o052","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-944c76689fd8a3e8fa86","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月，癸卯〖17〗，以抚军大将军司马景王为大将军。二月，立皇后张氏〖18〗，大赦。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"shaodi-q-o128","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b41ba43f7aca70555e83","layer":"original","quote":"冬十二月，吴大将全端、全怿等率众降〖38〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":533,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22},{"id":"shaodi-q-p012","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b21524fb470242deda03","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“初，孙权筑东兴堤，以遏巢湖。后征淮南，坏不复修。是岁，诸葛恪帅军更于堤左右，结山挟筑两城；使全端、留略守之，引军而还。诸葛诞言于司马景王曰：‘致人而不致于人者，此之谓也。今因其内侵，使文舒逼江陵，仲恭向武昌，以羁吴之上流；然后简精卒，攻两城：比救至，可大获也！’景王从之。”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fa5c9b0224b3bacd13f","start":0,"end":149},{"id":"wgc-q0005","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-280a1e8d1f852b5e78af","layer":"original","quote":"二年〖1〗，吴大将全琮数万众寇芍陂〖2〗。凌率诸军逆讨，与贼争塘，力战连日，贼退走。进封南乡侯，邑千三百五十户；迁车骑将军，仪同三司。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"wgc-q0027","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3e0f9aeb5d0f62e60b75","layer":"original","quote":"吴人大喜，遭将全怿、全端、唐咨、王祚等，率三万众，密与文钦俱来应诞。以诞为左都护，假节，大司徒〖8〗，骠骑将军，青州牧，寿春侯。是时镇南将军王基始至，督诸军围寿春，末合。咨、钦等从城东北，因山乘险，得将其众突入城。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107},{"id":"wgc-q0029","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-415a96152140983fb9ca","layer":"original","quote":"吴将朱异再以大众来迎诞等，渡黎浆水〖1〗；泰等逆与战，每摧其锋。孙綝以异战不进〖2〗，怒而杀之。城中食转少，外救不至，众无所恃。将军蒋班、焦彝，皆诞爪牙计事者也；弃诞，逾城自归大将军〖3〗。﹝一﹞大将军乃使反间，以奇变说全怿等〖4〗；怿等率众数千人，开门来出。城中震惧，不知所为。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140},{"id":"wgc-q0067","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"甘露二年，征诸葛诞为司空。时，会丧宁在家〖1〗，策诞必不从命，驰白文王。文王以事已施行，不复追改。﹝一﹞及诞反，车驾住项；文王至寿春，会复从行。初，吴大将全琮，孙权之婚亲重臣也〖2〗；琮子怿、孙静、从子端、翩、缉等，皆将兵来救诞。怿兄子辉、仪留建业，与其家内争讼；携其母，将部曲数十家渡江，自归文王。会建策，密为辉、仪作书，使辉、仪所亲信，赍入城告怿等，说“吴中怒怿等不能拔寿春，欲尽诛诸将家，故逃来归命”。怿等恐惧，遂将所领，开东城门出降，皆蒙封宠，城中由是乖离。寿春之破，会谋居多。亲待日隆，时人谓之子房〖3〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":258},{"id":"wgc-q0113","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-8152b96e80f85b084c0f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“蒋班、焦彝言于诸葛诞曰：‘朱异等以大众来而不能进，孙綝杀异而归江东；外以发兵为名，而内实坐须成败，其归可见矣。今宜及众心尚固，士卒思用，并力决死，攻其一面；虽不能尽克，犹可有全者。’文钦曰：‘江东乘战胜之威久矣，未有难北方者也。况公今举十余万之众内附，而钦与全端等皆同居死地，父子兄弟尽在江表？就孙綝不欲，主上及其亲戚岂肯听乎？且中国无岁无事，军民并疲，今守我一年，势力已困；异图生心，变故将起，以往准今，可计日而望也。’班、彝固劝之，钦怒，而诞欲杀班。二人惧，且知诞之必败也，十一月，乃相携而降。”","attribution":"汉晋春秋","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-37a96fab04e76e79956a","start":0,"end":262},{"id":"wgc-q0159","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-280a1e8d1f852b5e78af","layer":"original","quote":"吴大将全琮数万众寇芍陂〖2〗。凌率诸军逆讨，与贼争塘，力战连日，贼退走","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":6,"end":41},{"id":"wgc-q0275","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3e0f9aeb5d0f62e60b75","layer":"original","quote":"吴人大喜，遭将全怿、全端、唐咨、王祚等，率三万众，密与文钦俱来应诞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33},{"id":"wgc-q0287","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-415a96152140983fb9ca","layer":"original","quote":"大将军乃使反间，以奇变说全怿等〖4〗；怿等率众数千人，开门来出","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":98,"end":129},{"id":"wgc-q0434","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"琮子怿、孙静、从子端、翩、缉等，皆将兵来救诞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":92,"end":114},{"id":"wgc-q0437","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-19a57525c37bf4f5767a","layer":"original","quote":"怿等恐惧，遂将所领，开东城门出降，皆蒙封宠，城中由是乖离","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":204,"end":232},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o133b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8af6f7908a818f7cd9b1","layer":"original","quote":"琮与魏将王凌，战于芍陂；中郎将秦晃等十余人，战死。车骑将军朱然围樊，大将军诸葛瑾取柤中〖15〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":168,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":56,"end":104},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o132","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-339340f557e9065aedfa","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月〖10〗，大雪，平地深三尺，鸟兽死者太半。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"zhanggu-q-2113b80d6f9f8a3da0c7","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-027aa53bd5dbba95ebf6","layer":"original","quote":"时长公主婿卫将军全琮子寄，为霸宾客〖19〗；寄素倾邪〖20〗，谭所不纳。先是，谭弟承与张休俱北征寿春，全琮时为大都督；与魏将王凌战于芍陂，军不利，魏兵乘胜陷没五营将秦（儿）〔晃〕军；休、承奋击之，遂驻魏师〖21〗。时琮群子绪、端，亦并为将，因敌既驻，乃进击之：凌军用退","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
